[node name="LoreNPC" type="Node2D"]
script = ExtResource("1_lore")
lines = PackedStringArray("Stranger. You wake with no name, no master - only that blade, and the dark.", "You stand in Cairn. Once, a kingdom thrived here, deep beneath a sun it had learned to fear.", "We carved a world from the stone - halls, courts, a king upon a throne none now remember building.", "Then came the Silencing. In a single breath, a hundred years ago, all of it simply stopped. Mid-step. Mid-word.", "Everything but me. And now, you. The only things that still move in the deep.", "Are you the cause of our stillness? The cure? Or something Cairn made at the end, as a last hope? Even the stones do not say.", "I am only a fragment now - a shade of the watcher I was. I cannot follow you down, but I can point the way.", "Descend. Past the warrens, the flooded vaults, the iron and the dark. Find the Pale Sovereign upon the throne.", "And when you stand before what silenced us... decide. Whether Cairn is buried for good, or wakes once more.")

